OL,3,GNEWSAWoodland path cordoned off as rape
OL,4,Ainvestigated
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cordon has been set up at a woodland
OL,7,Fpath as police investigate a reported
OL,8,Frape.
OL,10,FDorset Police said a woman, aged in her
OL,11,F40s, reported being attacked in the
OL,12,FBoscombe area of Bournemouth on
OL,13,FWednesday at about 21:00 BST.
OL,15,FThe force said a detailed investigation
OL,16,Fwas being led by detectives, and the
OL,17,Fvictim was being supported by specially
OL,18,Ftrained officers.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
