OL,3,GNEWSAWoodland path cordoned off as rape
OL,4,Ainvestigated
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficers remain at Woodland Walk - a
OL,7,Fpath that runs between the centre of
OL,8,FBoscombe and the seafront - carrying
OL,9,Fout inquiries. No arrests have been
OL,10,Fmade.
